    p:milestone w:marmishMilestone ; p:source w:buildReportCommandPlan ; p:status p:active ;
    p:acceptance "Verify actual Cargo target and package-version binding, explicit revision and format values and exact stdout, stderr and exit status with an independent program and the original and generated client and daemon on both ARM64 hosts." .

